#. Tag: title
#: examples.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "&step; examples"
msgstr "&step; primjeri"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&step; package contains several instructive examples to help you understand "
"the principles of the application work. To open an example from the default "
"set choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Examples</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Open Example...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"main window menu."
msgstr ""
"&step; paket sadrži nekoliko poučnih primjera da vam pomognu da razumijete "
"principe rada aplikacije. Da otvorite primjer iz zadanog seta izaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Otvori primjer...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz glavnog prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can share your own examples with <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Examples</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Share Current Experiment...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or download examples shared by other users with "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Examples</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Download New Experiments...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. "
"Downloaded examples can be opened using <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Examples</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Open Downloaded Example...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Možete podijeliti svoje primjere sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Podijeli trenutni "
"eksperiment...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili preuzeti primjere koji su "
"podjeljeni od drugih korisnika sa <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Preuzmi nove eksperimente...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Preuzeti primjeri mogu biti otvoreni koristeći "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Primjeri</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Otvori preuzete primjere...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> meni "
"stavke."

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can find the descriptions of the default example files below."
msgstr "Možete naći opis datoteka zadanih primjera ispod."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "brownian.step"
msgstr "brownian.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plots trajectory of the rigid disk interacting with 40 particles that "
"randomly drifting in a box. This example simulates <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Brownian_motion\">Brownian motion</ulink> of ideal gas "
"particles."
msgstr ""
"Trajektorija krutog diska koji je u interakciji sa 40 čestica koje se "
"nasumice kreću u kutiji. Ovaj primjer simulira <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Brownian_motion\">Brownovo kretanje</ulink> za idealne "
"gasne čestice."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "doublependulum.step"
msgstr "doublependulum.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Double_pendulum\">double pendulum motion</ulink> using 2 massive particles "
"and two sticks."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer simulira <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Double_pendulum\">kretanje duplog njihala</ulink> koristeći 2 masivne "
"čestive i dva štapića."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "eightpendulum.step"
msgstr "eightpendulum.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example is a simple demonstration of the famous <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Newton%27s_cradle\">Newton's cradle</ulink>. It is done "
"in &step; using sticks, 8 discs and a box. The six balls in the middle are "
"not moving because they just transfer momentum and energy, not a motion."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer je jednostavna demonstracija poznate <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Newton%27s_cradle\">Newtonove kolijevke</ulink>.  Radi se "
"u &step; sa štapovima, 8 diskova i sa kutijom. Šest kugli u sredini se ne "
"miču zato što se samo prenosi impuls i energija, ali ne i kretanje."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "first.step: First example"
msgstr "first.step: Prvi primjer"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example has two parts. The first part contains two particles connected "
"by a spring and the second part contains two charged particles."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer ima dva dijela. Prvi dio sadrži dvije čestice povezane sa "
"oprugom i drugi dio sadrži dvije nabijene čestice."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two particles connected by a spring"
msgstr "Dvije čestice povezane oprugom"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this example two particles are added to the scene and spring is connected "
"between them. The properties of both the particles such as velocity, "
"momentum, position &etc; has been set in the properties browser. The "
"properties of the spring such as stiffness, restLength, damping &etc; also "
"has been set in the properties browser."
msgstr ""
"U ovom primjeru dvije čestice su dodane na scenu i opruga je povezana između "
"njih. Svojstva obje čestice kao što su brzina, impuls, pozicija &etc; je "
"bila postavljena u svojstvima preglednika. Svojstva opruge kao što su "
"ukočenost, dužina, prigušivanje &etc; su također postavljena u svojstvu "
"preglednika."

#. Tag: emphasis
#: examples.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Explanation of the simulation:"
msgstr "Objašnjenje simulacije:"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is good example of a simple harmonic motion. Here the acceleration of "
"the one particle is set in direction of positive x-axis and the acceleration "
"of the other particle is set along negative x-axis. As a result both the "
"particles pulls the spring in opposite directions, where as spring tries to "
"bring the two particles back to their original positions. Thus the system "
"executes simple harmonic motion. The simulation of the particles and spring "
"under these conditions can be seen on the scene."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je dobar primjer jednostavnog harmonijskog kretanja. Ovdje ubrzanje "
"jedne čestice je postavljeno u pravcu pozitivne x-ose i ubrzanje druge "
"čestice je postavljeno duž negativne x-ose. Kao rezultat obje čestice vuku "
"oprugu u suprotnim pravcima, gdje opruga pokušava vratiti dvije čestice u "
"njihove prvobitne položaje. Tako sistem vrši jednostavno harmonijsko "
"kretanje. Simulacija čestica i opruge pod ovim uvijetima se može vidjeti na "
"sceni."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two charged particles"
msgstr "Dvije nabijene čestice"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Velocity of the each charged particle is set in some direction so, the "
"charged particles moves in respective direction of their velocity but each "
"particle has been given a equal and opposite charge so the particles try to "
"attract each other. As a result the simulation of the charged particles "
"under these conditions can be seen on the scene."
msgstr ""
"Brzina svake nabijene čestice je postavljena u istom smjeru tako da, "
"nabijene čestice se kreću istom smjeru njihove brzine ali svaka čestica ima "
"dat jednak i suprotan naboj tako da čestice pokušavaju privuči jedna drugu. "
"Kao rezultat simulacija nabijenih čestica pod ovim uvjetima može se vidjeti "
"na sceni."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "fourpendula.step"
msgstr "fourpendula.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example is a correct demonstration of the <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Newton%27s_cradle\">Newton's cradle</ulink>. As the "
"system is imperfect two disks in the middle get visual movement with time."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer je ispravljen demonstracijom  <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/Newton%27s_cradle\">Newtonove kolijevke</ulink>. Kako sistem nije "
"idealan dva diska u sredini dobijaju vizualno kretanje sa vremenom."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "gas.step"
msgstr "gas.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates ideal gas pressure caused by <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Brownian_motion\">Brownian motion</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je primjer simulacije pritiska idealnog gasa <ulink url=\"http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Brownian_motion\">Brownovo gibanje</ulink>."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "graph.step"
msgstr "graph.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plots velocity vs. position graph for particle1 in the system of two "
"particles connected with a spring."
msgstr ""
"Nacrt brzine naspram pozicije grafa čestice1 u sistemu dvije čestice "
"povezane sa oprugom."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "liquid.step"
msgstr "liquid.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "This example simulates monoatomic liquid."
msgstr "Ovaj primjer simulira monoatomsku tečnost."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "lissajous.step"
msgstr "lissajous.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Lissajous_curve\">Lissajous curve</ulink> using two-particle model. The "
"parameters on the model can be changed using the controller at the center of "
"the world."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer simulira  <ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Lissajous_curve\">Lissajous krivulja</ulink>. Parametri na modelu mogu biti "
"promijenjeni koristeći kontrolor u centru svijeta."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "motor1.step"
msgstr "motor1.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simulates triangular rigid body under the loading of the three linear motors."
msgstr "Simulira trokutasto kruto tijelo ispod učitavanja tri linearna motora."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "motor.step"
msgstr "motor.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simulates interaction of the linear motor with a rigid rectangular body on a "
"spring."
msgstr ""
"Simulira interakciju linearnih motora sa krutim pravouglim tijelom na opruzi."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "note.step"
msgstr "note.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Example with LaTeX formula (<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Divergence_theorem\">divergence theorem</ulink>) and embedded image."
msgstr ""
"Primjer sa LaTeX formulom  (<ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Divergence_theorem\">teorema divergencije</ulink>) i ugrađena slika."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "resonance.step"
msgstr "resonance.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "This example simulates resonance in the system with angular motor."
msgstr "Ovaj primjer simuliše rezonance u sistemu sa ugaonim motorom."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "softbody.step"
msgstr "softbody.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates interaction of two rigid bodies with a soft body "
"between them."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer simulira interakciju dva kruta tijela sa mekim tijelom između "
"njih."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "solar.step"
msgstr "solar.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates the motion of Solar system major bodies (Sun and the "
"planets)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer simuliše kretanje glavnih tijela Solarnog sistema (Sunce i "
"planete)."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "springs.step"
msgstr "springs.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This example simulates the motion of the planar system of five particles "
"connected with four springs."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj primjer simulira kretanje planarnog sistema pet čestica povezanim sa "
"četiri opruge."

#. Tag: term
#: examples.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "wave.step"
msgstr "wave.step"

#. Tag: para
#: examples.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The graph on the scene shows oscillations of the green particle. When you "
"start simulation the wave starts to travel from the red particle. The blue "
"particle will reflect the wave and it will travel in reverse direction until "
"the red particle reflects in again. After some time the wave will vanish "
"because springs have damping."
msgstr ""
"Graf na sceni prikazuje oscijalacije na zelenoj čestici. Kada pokrenete "
"simulaciju talas počinje put od crvene čestice. Plava čestica će odbiti "
"talas i on će putovati u suprotnom smjeru dok ga crvena čestica ne odbije "
"opet. Nakon nekog vremena talas će nestati zbog prigušivanja opruge."
